  "paradigm_pack_notes": "Only Schrodinger, Cactuaroni, and Sahagin Prince have the Auto-Haste ability available for infusion (Yeoman and Samovira have it red-locked). Auto-Haste, Resist Elements +30%, and Auto-Tetradefense are the only three abilities with the highest (ninth) rank, so they can never be replaced by other abilities.\n\nThe Schrodinger is a Saboteur. It begins as a rank three monster, and can be raised all the way to level 70 and rank five, with two choices of ATB segments or Role bonuses on the way. It acquires various Saboteur spells, and ones that the player cannot learn, like Curse. It has slow casting speed.",
